{"request":{"path":"/rest/contents/search","query":{"limit":3,"offset":0,"projection":"full","sort":"viewsCount:desc"},"body":{"operator":"and","filters":{"format":{"includes":["video"]},"publishedAt":{"after":"2026-06-27","before":"2026-09-27"}},"queries":[{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["restaurant","restaurants"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["dubai"],"operator":"or"}}}},{"operator":"or","filters":{"caption":{"includesExactly":{"values":["before and after","transformation"],"operator":"or"}},"transcript":{"includesExactly":{"values":["before and after","transformation"],"operator":"or"}}}}]}},"status":200,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-27T10:25:48.492Z","response":{"data":{"aggregations":{"totalViewsCount":21500,"totalInteractionsCount":773,"totalEngagementRatePerViews":0.03595348837209302,"totalEngagementRatePerFollowers":0.03943877551020408},"results":[{"id":"cnt_64c2e81968bac7fd079b749bbb32","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"tiktok","profileHandle":"catalistmedia","profileDisplayName":"CATALIST Sri Lanka","format":"video","caption":"From a Rs.100 hot dog stand to a Sri Lankan brand with 11 outlets and a franchise in Japan. Arjuna Vimukthi Narampanawe built Fab Ceylon from the ground up, proving that creativity, persistence, and a clear vision can turn a small idea into a global opportunity. With no business background, Arjuna started his journey in hospitality after studying at St. Sylvester’s College and gaining international experience across Japan, Singapore, the USA, and Dubai. When he returned to Sri Lanka, he began with a simple hot dog stand. That small venture became Fab Ceylon, a restaurant brand known for unique dining experiences, creative presentations, and a modern take on Sri Lankan hospitality. By serving food in unexpected ways and creating memorable experiences, Fab Ceylon attracted both local customers and international travellers. Even during COVID-19, the brand adapted through digital transformation and continued growing. Today, Fab Ceylon serves over 1,000 customers daily, operates 11 outlets, employs more than 200 people, and has expanded internationally through its Japan franchise. A journey that started with a Rs.100 hot dog became a story of Sri Lankan entrepreneurship, innovation, and global ambition. #SriLankaBusiness #SriLankanEntrepreneurs #FabCeylon #SriLankaHospitality #MadeInSriLanka","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_9c4401c2869d4b75eb37c9b2afbb","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T08:49:50.000Z","profileId":"prf_5ba87c55761e7b1fec09c640c7d0","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":21500,"likesCount":633,"sharesCount":132,"commentsCount":8,"interactionsCount":773,"engagementRatePerViews":3.5953488372093023,"engagementRatePerFollowers":3.9438775510204085,"profileFollowersCount":19600,"profileFollowingCount":3,"profilePostsCount":54,"mediaCount":1,"duration":78,"hashtags":["#srilankabusiness","#srilankanentrepreneurs","#fabceylon","#srilankahospitality","#madeinsrilanka"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"7670838157943786772","profilePlatformId":"7339838286883570696","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/catalistmedia/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Spotlighting success stories from Sri Lanka 🚀\nDM your suggestions—let's hit 20k","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"This Sri Lankan built fab salon into 11 outlets with a franchise in Japan But it all started with a hot dog stand selling hot dogs for 100 rupees Arjuna Vimukti Narampanawe grew up in Kandy with no business background. After St. Sylvester's College, he studied hospitality management, then joined Hilton Colombo as a banquet coordinator. He sharpened his craft across Japan, Singapore, the USA and Dubai. Back home He chased his dream the only way he could afford a small hot dog stand selling hot dogs for just 100 rupees That stand became fab salon. Arjuna spotted a gap Sri Lankans had little access to creative global dining experiences So he served dishes on shovels boats and traditional petagama chests Sparking conversations that turned critics into customers the buzz worked foreign tourists started sharing fab salon online And when COVID hit Arjuna pivoted the entire brand online without missing a beat Today fab salon serves more than 1,000 customers every day across 11 outlets and employs more than 200 people The brand won the platinum award at the Golden Feather Awards 2023 and is now franchised in Japan With the USA, Singapore and Hong Kong next from a 100 rupee hot dog to a global Sri Lankan brand Arjuna proves you do not need money you need movement","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.072,"endSeconds":4.792,"text":"This Sri Lankan built fab salon into 11 outlets with a franchise in Japan"},{"startSeconds":4.792,"endSeconds":8.792,"text":"But it all started with a hot dog stand selling hot dogs for 100 rupees"},{"startSeconds":9.032,"endSeconds":13.812,"text":"Arjuna Vimukti Narampanawe grew up in Kandy with no business background. After St."},{"startSeconds":13.812,"endSeconds":19.352,"text":"Sylvester's College, he studied hospitality management, then joined Hilton Colombo as a banquet coordinator."},{"startSeconds":19.352,"endSeconds":24.752,"text":"He sharpened his craft across Japan, Singapore, the USA and Dubai. Back home"},{"startSeconds":24.752,"endSeconds":30.672,"text":"He chased his dream the only way he could afford a small hot dog stand selling hot dogs for just 100 rupees"},{"startSeconds":30.672,"endSeconds":37.872,"text":"That stand became fab salon. Arjuna spotted a gap Sri Lankans had little access to creative global dining experiences"},{"startSeconds":37.872,"endSeconds":42.032,"text":"So he served dishes on shovels boats and traditional petagama chests"},{"startSeconds":42.332,"endSeconds":49.092,"text":"Sparking conversations that turned critics into customers the buzz worked foreign tourists started sharing fab salon online"},{"startSeconds":49.092,"endSeconds":53.512,"text":"And when COVID hit Arjuna pivoted the entire brand online without missing a beat"},{"startSeconds":53.512,"endSeconds":61.352,"text":"Today fab salon serves more than 1,000 customers every day across 11 outlets and employs more than 200 people"},{"startSeconds":61.352,"endSeconds":67.832,"text":"The brand won the platinum award at the Golden Feather Awards 2023 and is now franchised in Japan"},{"startSeconds":67.832,"endSeconds":74.232,"text":"With the USA, Singapore and Hong Kong next from a 100 rupee hot dog to a global Sri Lankan brand"},{"startSeconds":74.232,"endSeconds":77.592,"text":"Arjuna proves you do not need money you need movement"}],"frames":[{"id":"med_a5511824b483b6498d379f860215","position":1,"timestampSeconds":1.4,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/1_1.40.webp"},{"id":"med_aa72be8e35a8f8ad2bd461ffb4d2","position":2,"timestampSeconds":1.43,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/2_1.43.webp"},{"id":"med_8b16feed4cd7368a7f00ca36d789","position":3,"timestampSeconds":1.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/3_1.50.webp"},{"id":"med_8d06f86bae2a694a8f610225dd19","position":4,"timestampSeconds":1.9,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/4_1.90.webp"},{"id":"med_74d11f276a8c631038e554d72a34","position":5,"timestampSeconds":3.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7670838157943786772/5_3.50.webp"},{"id":"med_bad97068b5bd7e782d603f361103","position":6,"timestampSecon